Segmenta browser extensions
==========================

segmenta-chromium.zip  Google Chrome, Chromium, Brave, Microsoft Edge, Vivaldi, Opera
segmenta-firefox.zip   Firefox (temporary load from about:debugging)

Install from the Navegadores page in Segmenta, or load the archive manually:

  Chrome family  chrome://extensions -> Developer mode -> Load unpacked (unzip first)
  Firefox        about:debugging#/runtime/this-firefox -> Load Temporary Add-on

The native host manifest must exist for the browser; Segmenta can install the
per-user copy from the same page (extension.install-native).
